    {
      "section": "content.title-text",
      "content": {
        "title": "There were many levels to this problem",
        "body": [
          {
            "text": "Everyone deserves access to important information that makes sense to them. But every person has a different level of understanding and reading ability.",
            "highlights": [
              "Everyone"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "How do you bring to life a platform delivering disease learning information that makes sense to each and every individual, at a time when they most need clear, concise answers?"
          },
          {
            "text": "The answer became very clear—we had to create a platform that adjusted to each user’s reading level. This solution clearly didn’t exist. Yet.",
            "highlights": [
              "each"
            ],
            "strong": [
              "The answer became very clear—we had to create a platform that adjusted to each user’s reading level. This solution clearly didn’t exist. Yet."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "highlight": "many"
